OL,4,CNorse Atlantic suspends all flights as 
OL,5,Cit faces potential collapse            
OL,6,GThe Norwegian low cost carrier Norse   
OL,7,GAtlantic Airways has suspended all     
OL,8,Gflights as it rushes to resolve what   
OL,9,Git warned is a critical financial      
OL,10,Gsituation.                             
OL,12,FThe airline said if no solution can be 
OL,13,Ffound, it intends to file for          
OL,14,Fbankruptcy.                            
OL,16,FIt uses a fleet of 12 Boeing 787       
OL,17,Faircraft on long-haul routes from a    
OL,18,Fnumber of European airports, including 
OL,19,FLondon Gatwick, Rome and Oslo.         
